  "summary": "C7 loads the 60x60 region (62.26-63.44N, 18.74-19.92E) for 1991-12-27..2003-01-05 plus summer 2017 and saves it to /tmp/X.npy. C8 reads that file back and computes per-cell hazen 90th-percentile thresholds from \u00b15-day pools, then applies a wrapping 31-day smoothing. The target days (DOY 153-244) therefore draw on thresholds for DOY 138-259, i.e. baseline values from May 12 to Sep 20 in each year. All 92 target days of every sea cell feed the hot/run/gap logic that produces the saved mask."
